            <title>[KYLIN-5458] The number of indexes generated by the aggregate group is within the range, but an error is still reported: the number of indexes exceeds the upper limit allowed by the system</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5458</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When generating layout, some of the layout id should not be calculated, but they are incorrectly calculated currently.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13055576/13055576_image-20221215-134310.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Only ++ when returning true.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;FixDesign&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Fix Design&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Please refer to the pic, ++ should be placed upon the red-arrowhead-pointed part, and for the red square, only needs cuboidCount &amp;gt; maxCombination.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
